# Metadata that must never ship to GitHub — everything under references/,
# except the tiered reference document SKILL.md links to, which is part of
# the skill (git cannot re-include a file from an excluded directory, so the
# rule excludes the contents rather than the directory).
references/*
!references/longitudinal-analysis-reference.md
examples/_runtime/
